   "evidence": "TauCeti/Topology/Homotopy/Cube/Radius.lean:123 `theorem cubeRadius_eq_one_iff (z : I^N) : cubeRadius z = 1 \u2194 z \u2208 Cube.boundary N`, with `cubeRadius z = 2 * dist z cubeCenter` (line 88). The sup distance to `cubeCenter` is half the sup norm of `2y - 1`, and the new proof (hcoord, pi_norm_lt_iff, norm_le_pi_norm) mirrors lines 124\u2013150 (dist_pi_lt_iff, dist_le_pi_dist).",
