   "fix": "Prove the bridge `\u2016(cubeHomeomorphClosedBall N y : N \u2192 \u211d)\u2016 = cubeRadius y`: coordinatewise `|2*y i - 1| = 2*|y i - 1/2|`, via `dist_apply_cubeCenter` and `pi_norm`/`dist_pi`. Then derive the iff as `bridge \u25b8 cubeRadius_eq_one_iff y`, stated with RHS `y \u2208 Cube.boundary N`. This also simplifies `diskHomeomorphCube_mem_boundary_iff`, which no longer needs to unfold `Cube.boundary`/`Set.mem_ofPred_eq`.",
